sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as Producer
  participant P1 as Owner DB
  participant P2 as Kafka
  participant P3 as Consumer
  participant P4 as Consumer DB
  alt Required current prerequisites hold
    P0->>P1: 1 Commit business change audit and outbox
    P1->>P0: 2 Return durable owner result
    P0->>P2: 3 Publish leased outbox event
    P2->>P0: 4 Acknowledge publication
    P2->>P3: 5 Deliver event at least once
    P3->>P4: 6 Commit inbox key and local projection
    P4->>P3: 7 Return committed consumer result
    P3->>P2: 8 Acknowledge after local commit
  else A prerequisite fails or an external outcome is uncertain
    Note over P0,P4: Crash after publish can duplicate delivery. Inbox deduplication handles it; conflicts are quarantined, not silently overwritten.
  end
